  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "道具いらずの簡単組み立て！初めてでも簡単に組み立てられる「ポケプラクイック!!」から「ニャオハ」、「クワッス」、「ホゲータ」がセットになって登場！",
      "en": "Easy assembly without any tools! \"Nyaoha \", \" Kwassu \", and \" Hogeta \" are now available as a set from \" Pokepura Quick!!\", which can be easily assembled even for the first time!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パルデア地方で出会う最初の3匹を並べてディスプレイしよう！",
      "en": "• Display the first three animals you meet in the Paldea region side by side!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• こだわりのパーツ分割で簡単組み立て＆カラフルな仕上がりを両立。",
      "en": "• Easy assembly and colorful finish achieved by carefully dividing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ランナーを見た瞬間、出来上がりが思い浮かぶシンプル仕様。",
      "en": "• Simple specifications that make you imagine the finished product the moment you see the Runner."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 道具を使わないタッチゲート方式。",
      "en": "• Touch gate method without tools."
